  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2002-08-28T01:00:00Z\"\u003e28 August 2002\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  The Government\u0026#39;s Approach To Sustainable Development\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Marian Hobbs\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Environment\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/core/misc/icons/e32700/error.svg\" alt=\"Image removed.\" title=\"This image has been removed. For security reasons, only images from the local domain are allowed.\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"filter-image-invalid\" loading=\"lazy\"/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\nThis report outlines the Government\u0026#39;s present approach to sustainable development and illustrates this by describing a wide range of activities across the government sector.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut as it stands the report is incomplete. While it is a useful step towards a New Zealand Sustainable Development Strategy, it is clear that further work is needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe next step in the process is the World Summit in Johannesburg. After the Summit, we will review the Programme of Action and decide whether there are new issues that New Zealand needs to address.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Government will also need to form a view about priorities. Some of the priorities are already evident in this report - such as economic growth, the implications of international population change for New Zealand, decoupling of economic growth from environmental harm, governance for sustainable development, and implementation of the Local Government Bill. Others may emerge from the World Summit and the process of engagement that follows.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce a draft strategy has been written there will be a process of consultation and an opportunity for everyone to comment and contribute their ideas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/core/misc/icons/e32700/error.svg\" alt=\"Image removed.\" title=\"This image has been removed. For security reasons, only images from the local domain are allowed.\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"filter-image-invalid\" loading=\"lazy\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eHon Marian Hobbs\u003cbr/\u003e\nMinister for the Environment\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDownload/view documents as PDF files\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cb\u003eDocument\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/core/misc/icons/e32700/error.svg\" alt=\"Image removed.\" title=\"This image has been removed. For security reasons, only images from the local domain are allowed.\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"filter-image-invalid\" loading=\"lazy\"/\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/core/misc/icons/e32700/error.svg\" alt=\"Image removed.\" title=\"This image has been removed. For security reasons, only images from the local domain are allowed.\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"filter-image-invalid\" loading=\"lazy\"/\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/core/misc